Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.24,0:00:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總算來了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:06.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你久等了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.17,0:00:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真懷念啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:12.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是我被召喚來的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:14.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法陣已經畫好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:17.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,儀式的準備完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:24.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 她是艾莉西亞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:26.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為一些原因 允許她同行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:27.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不會出手的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真意外
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還以為她會不樂意的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:40.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個儀式 是為了將魔力注滿克雷布斯庫爾姆的靈魂嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.25,0:00:41.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將強大的魔力 注入魔王大人的靈魂裡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.19,0:00:51.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣一來 魔王大人就能加速復活 大概
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.51,0:00:57.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我無法相信魔族
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.75,0:00:59.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那要就此作罷嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.57,0:01:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想打倒克雷布斯庫爾姆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:06.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信你 迪亞布羅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請你…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.81,0:01:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將我從這命運中 拯救出來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.24,0:01:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天 就要在這裡實現與你的約定 蕾姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.90,0:01:38.08,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}塞がれた過去から抜け出して
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.51,0:01:43.72,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}次の場所へ思い走らせる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.55,0:01:49.01,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}辿り著く場所なんてなくても
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.23,0:01:54.80,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}今日の涙が星になる日まで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.92,0:02:06.42,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1273.333,10)\fs36.667\blur2\fad(100,100)}２つの　小さな命が燃えている
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.72,0:01:57.68,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}君は僕のよう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.23,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}僕は君のよう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.51,0:02:05.39,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)\pos()}違うのに同じ　背中合わせだね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:13.54,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}覚醒の果に　決意輝けて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.95,0:02:14.72,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1273.333,6.667)\fs36.667\blur2\fad(100,100)}Go into the brand new world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.07,0:02:16.19,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}負けたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.19,0:02:17.84,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}逃げたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.06,0:02:20.63,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}不可能なんて信じない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:25.44,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}奪い奪われる日々は要らない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:28.48,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}夢を見て　夢に愛され
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.73,0:02:31.22,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}新たなる光になる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.52,0:02:36.72,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}優しさだけじゃ誰も守れないならば
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.04,0:02:42.68,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}本當の強さを知りたいから
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.90,0:01:38.08,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}突破過去的重重封鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.51,0:01:43.72,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}向著彼岸　一往無前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.55,0:01:49.01,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}就算道路永無止境
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.23,0:01:54.80,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}今日的淚水終將化為星辰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.92,0:02:06.42,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos(1273.333,703.333)\blur2\fs36.667\fad(100,100)}一對微小的生命　在此刻燃燒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.72,0:01:57.68,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}你中有我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.23,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}我中有你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.51,0:02:05.39,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}雖截然不同　卻並肩作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:13.54,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}決意指向　覺醒的前方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.07,0:02:16.19,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}不想認輸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.19,0:02:17.84,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}不願逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.06,0:02:20.63,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}相信事事皆有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:25.44,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}遠離爭鬥的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:28.48,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}懷抱夢想　深愛希望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.73,0:02:31.22,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}成為新的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.52,0:02:36.72,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}只有溫柔　無法守護
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.04,0:02:42.68,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}那就去找到　真正的強大吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.79,0:02:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就快點開始儀式吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.56,0:03:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要將你的魔力 注入她腹中的 魔王大人的靈魂裡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.92,0:03:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣一來 魔王大人 就會復活
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:11.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到自己 會躺在魔族畫出的魔法陣上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給魔王注入魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:16.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我從沒想過會有這一天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.43,0:03:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:31.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能看見了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:33.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是克雷布斯庫爾姆的魔力嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好熱！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.69,0:03:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅的…進來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:48.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還差得遠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.38,0:03:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔王大人還在更深處
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.83,0:03:54.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有勾到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.03,0:03:54.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:57.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把肚子開個洞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.29,0:04:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在更靠近的地方注入
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.06,0:04:02.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼做的話 蕾姆會死的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.62,0:04:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洞 有了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:07.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.85,0:04:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪裡？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:11.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.16,0:04:20.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手指 插進 那個洞裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:23.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手指？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:25.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:28.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不不不不不！\N等等！這怎麼行！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這也 太 勁 爆 了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.53,0:04:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還沒做好心理準備呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.09,0:04:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然 拯救蕾姆的覺悟我是有的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.70,0:04:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…這沒問題嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.22,0:04:40.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這怎麼看都出局了吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.17,0:04:42.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:43.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.78,0:04:45.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請動手吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.28,0:04:48.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果這有必要的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不知道怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.36,0:04:51.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:53.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我怎麼下得去手啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.79,0:04:57.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請拯救我 迪亞布羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.93,0:05:20.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.09,0:05:22.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅 進來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.70,0:05:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中注意力！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.93,0:05:29.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒到 克雷布斯庫爾姆還遠著！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再深一點！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.45,0:05:39.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看見了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好強的魄力…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.93,0:05:43.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會有錯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.08,0:05:45.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是魔王克雷布斯庫爾姆的魔力！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.84,0:05:46.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.72,0:05:48.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接受我的魔力吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:50.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了 迪亞布羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔王大人 復活！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.74,0:06:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:35.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是不能被復活的禁忌啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.42,0:06:38.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.41,0:06:39.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作點！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.12,0:06:45.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了 請你一定要贏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.63,0:06:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.15,0:06:49.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有義務見證這一刻！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.79,0:06:51.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不允許你擅自死掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.01,0:06:58.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.41,0:06:59.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是 魔王！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克雷布斯庫爾姆呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打擾魔王沉眠的人 就是你們嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔王大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.47,0:07:39.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔王？！那就是嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.07,0:07:42.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是 克雷布斯庫爾姆嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫 艾德爾卡特
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:51.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衷心恭喜您 復活！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.37,0:07:52.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓魔王復活之功 我要好好獎賞你！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.44,0:08:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你真的是魔王克雷布斯庫爾姆嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.45,0:08:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.72,0:08:02.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.97,0:08:06.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和想像中的不太一樣 不管了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾名迪亞布羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:10.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來自異世界的魔王
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.57,0:08:12.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是來取你性命的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.47,0:08:16.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 喚醒魔王的人就是你嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.75,0:08:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯 作為獎勵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:21.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就讓你見識見識真正的恐懼！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.76,0:08:30.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就用最殘忍的方法把你殺死！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:34.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯！最殘忍的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:43.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…應該是有最殘忍的方法來著…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什麼來著？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:48.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 不是吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.03,0:08:50.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙難道連怎麼戰鬥都忘了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.78,0:08:52.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 不管了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正只要把一切都燃燒殆盡就行了！這樣才像魔王嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.39,0:08:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能這樣啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.33,0:08:59.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:01.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔王大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.82,0:09:04.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼能聽人族的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.48,0:09:05.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.23,0:09:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 既然她說不能 那就是不能的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.13,0:09:12.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.12,0:09:14.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道是失去了一部分記憶嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔王理應毀滅人族！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.53,0:09:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道不是這樣嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:22.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我記得好像是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.73,0:09:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.91,0:09:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.15,0:09:27.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直覺得很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.39,0:09:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼 魔王一定要毀滅人族呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我記得好像是有什麼理由的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.52,0:09:38.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你並非自願
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.49,0:09:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就不要再繼續殺戮了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也拜託你！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.51,0:09:44.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,殺人是不好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也對…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:51.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正也想不到殺戮的理由 那算了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就不殺了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:55.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的假的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是認真的嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.60,0:10:00.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔王竟然不殺人族？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.14,0:10:03.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,殺了人族又不能填飽肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.61,0:10:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德爾卡特！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.91,0:10:06.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣你真的能接受嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.73,0:10:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對艾德爾卡特來說 只有魔王大人 最重要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.85,0:10:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔王大人覺得這樣可以的話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.44,0:10:16.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就可以
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.64,0:10:21.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起這個 本魔王肚肚餓餓了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有帶零食哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.68,0:10:24.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.59,0:10:26.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是餅乾哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.52,0:10:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好吃啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.08,0:10:37.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還要嗎 我這還有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:41.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個真好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.03,0:10:45.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還是第一次吃到這麼美味的食物！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:48.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多虧你 我想起魔王的使命了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.23,0:10:51.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是要吃盡這世上所有的餅乾！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:55.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是魔王復活的意義！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.58,0:10:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怕不是活在夢裡吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.34,0:10:59.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 餅乾已經沒有了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫雪拉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我手上沒有了 得回城裡一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.76,0:11:05.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.44,0:11:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你帶路吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.04,0:11:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？！你要去城裡嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.81,0:11:10.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可是魔王啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:20.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅 我一個人能走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.83,0:11:22.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我下來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.40,0:11:24.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的體力還沒恢復吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.97,0:11:28.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不想被你拖後腿放慢了速度
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:30.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.39,0:11:35.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能接受那個嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.01,0:11:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一時很難接受
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.01,0:11:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}城裡有多少餅乾啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我 我母親 我祖母…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.68,0:11:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}去店裡的話就有很多哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:43.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都一直被魔王折磨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.66,0:11:43.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}多到你吃不完！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}真的嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒克雷布斯庫爾姆 就是我的人生目標
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}能讓我吃個飽嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.37,0:11:49.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.31,0:11:53.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然她不殺人族 就沒有必要戰鬥了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.16,0:11:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果這是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.23,0:11:58.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅大人！看上面！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.94,0:12:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？上面？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:06.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.33,0:12:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.41,0:12:16.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔王大人 恭喜您復活
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什麼人？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.12,0:12:24.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是侍奉先先代魔王大人的奧羅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:25.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奧羅？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.60,0:12:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在「十字幻想曲」中也有出現啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奧羅 比先先代魔王還要長壽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.80,0:12:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,據說是最古老也最強大的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.67,0:12:41.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直耐心等待著魔王大人的復活
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.71,0:12:46.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了慶祝這一喜事 還請您容許我獻上賀禮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:47.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜事？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.21,0:12:48.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.40,0:12:53.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把這些 不知為何還活著的人族殺光
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.83,0:12:57.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就以此盛大慶祝魔王大人的復活
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:12:59.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.10,0:13:02.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,殺了人族 就吃不到餅乾了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.42,0:13:10.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德爾卡特 魔王大人竟然說不殺人族
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.43,0:13:15.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德爾卡特 已經不明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔王就是魔之王！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:21.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔就應該誅殺人族！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.24,0:13:22.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.46,0:13:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就恭請不完全的魔王大人 進行輪迴轉生吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.32,0:13:32.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德爾卡特？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 自作主張！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.32,0:13:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有什麼 比魔王大人的意志更重要！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.80,0:13:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個世界裡的魔族也有自己的職責
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.48,0:13:44.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如此不完全的魔王大人復活
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.71,0:13:47.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就由我來糾正！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.09,0:13:56.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉西亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.01,0:13:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保護好蕾姆她們！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.31,0:13:58.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.10,0:13:59.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會讓他靠近的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.92,0:14:02.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他看來是最強的魔族
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.48,0:14:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用擔心 我馬上結束這一切
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:09.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愚蠢的艾德爾卡特
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就憑你 還想打敗我嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:15.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔族
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.21,0:14:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然反抗魔王大人 不應該！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.95,0:14:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔王大人的靈魂是有限的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.11,0:14:25.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要那個克雷布斯庫爾姆大人存在一日
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.60,0:14:28.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的克雷布斯庫爾姆大人就無法復活！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.11,0:14:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的愚蠢行徑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.15,0:14:35.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,招致了不完全的魔王大人復活！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.76,0:14:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然避開了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.28,0:14:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,區區混魔族 還妄想與魔族抗衡？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.82,0:14:49.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:51.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來你雖然長壽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:53.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卻欠缺了重要的常識啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.47,0:14:55.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾乃迪亞布羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:14:59.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蠢貨 膽敢挑戰真正的魔王！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.36,0:15:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.43,0:15:01.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逗你玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:03.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定不知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.34,0:15:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是一名普通的玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「燃燒爆炎」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:11.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.97,0:15:14.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:18.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「超級地雷」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.19,0:15:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙 好快！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:26.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「石英飛槍」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.68,0:15:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放馬過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.92,0:15:41.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這難道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.36,0:15:42.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法反射？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.58,0:15:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵？一擊就察覺到我的力量了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.30,0:15:47.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:49.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法反射是腦之魔王
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.55,0:15:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恩克巴羅斯大人的固有能力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你會…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.14,0:15:58.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在遊戲中首殺那個恩克巴羅斯的人就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.86,0:16:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這戒指 就是當時的戰利品
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.77,0:16:06.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙 不愧是從先先代魔王的時代存活至今
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.97,0:16:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確實博學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.48,0:16:12.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 你終於明白了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.38,0:16:15.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎麼掙扎 你都沒有勝算
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.12,0:16:25.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不完全的魔王大人 就請你受死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:27.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.42,0:16:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「光芒飛彈」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.21,0:16:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 居然保護了魔王嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}蕾姆 沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}蕾姆大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.90,0:16:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.03,0:16:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得不錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.66,0:16:42.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要表揚你！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.68,0:16:44.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對不對
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.27,0:16:47.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種時候 應該說「謝謝你」啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.45,0:16:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.68,0:16:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.43,0:16:52.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.04,0:16:56.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這魔力如此強大
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.48,0:17:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不可能是人族
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:02.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都說了 我是魔王
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:05.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不只無知 還老糊塗了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.80,0:17:11.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是這力量 非比尋常
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無法理解
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.95,0:17:27.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放走他 這樣好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒興致了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.64,0:17:31.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不在乎逃竄的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.06,0:17:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然也可以追擊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.76,0:17:36.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果遭遇魔法以外的範圍攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.54,0:17:38.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以我們這人數 我根本護不過來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:42.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能讓大家遭遇危險了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.79,0:17:45.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是浪費時間
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.31,0:17:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該很快能看見烏魯格寨橋了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.69,0:17:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.70,0:17:55.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔王大人…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:57.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您要去人族的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.77,0:18:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德爾卡特無法靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:02.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就在森林裡等著
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.32,0:18:04.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您隨時可以呼喚我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.70,0:18:05.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有勞你了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:08.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.64,0:18:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不勝榮幸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.64,0:18:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個 關於克雷布斯庫爾姆大人…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在城裡叫她這個名字 是否不太合適呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的確 會引起不必要的混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.98,0:18:26.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔王就是魔王
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.36,0:18:29.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過為了餅乾 稱呼這點事不算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.85,0:18:31.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我准了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.12,0:18:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.10,0:18:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 就叫你克露姆醬吧 怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.92,0:18:44.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.64,0:18:46.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅一用魔法 就會累得沒有力氣的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.85,0:18:55.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來 人族好像用了魔力就會疲勞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.52,0:18:57.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克露姆醬你不會嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.21,0:18:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我是魔王！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:19:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的魔力取之不盡 用之不竭！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.69,0:19:02.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這也太作弊了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蕾姆和艾莉西亞去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這房間不夠大家一起睡的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.43,0:19:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蕾姆說要在艾莉西亞小姐房裡過夜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.19,0:19:12.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.51,0:19:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:22.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正蕾姆也不在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.97,0:19:27.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想像上次那樣 讓迪亞布羅打起精神來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:28.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…等！喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.97,0:19:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人族真是有趣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.56,0:19:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣補充魔力的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:35.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克露姆醬要不要來試試？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.85,0:19:38.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣做的話 自己也能打起精神來的哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.40,0:19:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.13,0:19:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給予魔力的一方也能打起精神來嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.64,0:19:42.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我試試
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:46.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯…這樣嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.86,0:19:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:52.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說就這樣擠壓 就能打起精神來！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.03,0:19:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的確！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.18,0:19:55.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本魔王也覺得很好玩！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.67,0:19:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這什麼情況啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.63,0:19:58.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:19:59.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全身像過電一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.80,0:20:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克露姆強大的魔力 在往我身上躥！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.88,0:20:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.01,0:20:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣舒服嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.36,0:20:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅 怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.12,0:20:13.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打起精神來了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:16.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡！可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.57,0:20:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想盯著看！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.74,0:20:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我是面對這種狀況也能大大方方的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.57,0:20:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的人生就該完全不同了吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.28,0:20:29.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害！有什麼 從裡面！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.09,0:20:34.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像 魔力在往我身體裡跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.77,0:20:52.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的MP 全滿了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.27,0:20:55.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太強了 魔王
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.21,0:21:05.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女孩子穿什麼甲胄？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.32,0:21:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太不像樣了 快摘下來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.40,0:21:10.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那本書和你的教育不合
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.86,0:21:12.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我丟掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:13.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是為了你好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.48,0:21:16.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,緊急情況下 優先保護人族
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.72,0:21:18.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亞人可以先不用管
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.60,0:21:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了國家的繁榮 有時候也需要犧牲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.26,0:21:24.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明白嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.65,0:21:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉西亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:32.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須讓魔王大人 履行她的職責
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.29,0:21:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了將人族從這世上抹除
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.06,0:21:39.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實現完美的美好世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.01,0:21:43.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要緊吧 薩多勒大人？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.34,0:21:44.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您感覺如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:46.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.32,0:21:48.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺糟透了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.40,0:21:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這世上竟還有對我的力量抱有懷疑的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.95,0:21:55.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神是不會高興的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.45,0:21:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕不會放過
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:21:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那幫亞人！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:09.75,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}むしゃくしゃな心の中　痛いんだ　これはきっと...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.56,0:22:11.91,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}これはきっと...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.91,0:22:29.16,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}隣にいると胸が苦しくなって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.07,0:22:33.31,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}ため息だって出ちゃう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.84,0:22:40.09,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}ねぇもっと教えて好きな場所とか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.36,0:22:43.46,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}ついでに好きなタイプとか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.56,0:22:50.61,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}誰に言われてもう止まれない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:57.91,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}だって仕方がない　これが戀だ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.46,0:23:02.64,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}朝起きてあなたが好き
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.12,0:23:07.76,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}最悪な日でもあなたが好き
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.76,0:23:12.91,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}會えなくてもあなたが好き
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.46,0:23:18.13,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}もしも生まれ変わってもあなたが好き
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.11,0:23:23.08,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}Darlin', make me happy lalala I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.26,0:23:28.76,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}Darlin', make me happy lalala I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:09.75,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{blur3\fad(100,100)}心煩意亂　隱隱作痛　這一定是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.56,0:22:11.91,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{blur3\fad(100,100)}這一定是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.91,0:22:29.16,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}在你身旁　就苦悶不已
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.07,0:22:33.31,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}不住發出歎息
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.84,0:22:40.09,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}能不能告訴我　你喜歡去哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.36,0:22:43.46,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}順便請問　你喜歡什麼類型呀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.56,0:22:50.61,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}任誰也無法阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:57.91,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}無可奈何　這就是愛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.46,0:23:02.64,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}早上醒來　就想著你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.12,0:23:07.76,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}糟糕的日子裡　也愛著你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.76,0:23:12.91,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}就算見不到面　也還惦記你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.46,0:23:18.13,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}到了下輩子　也還是喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.11,0:23:23.08,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}Darlin', make me happy lalala I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.26,0:23:28.76,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}Darlin', make me happy lalala I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.61,0:23:35.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔王 復活了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.28,0:23:37.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醜陋的人族即將毀滅
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.85,0:23:39.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 克露姆
